  {
   "id": "disaster-band-229138@major-2023-02-22",
   "gameId": "disaster-band-229138",
   "displayName": "Disaster Band: Update with choir and new track",
   "kind": "major",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2023-02-22T22:07:10.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Hello chaos musicians,",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "we proudly give you a new update for Disaster Band.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Next to a few optimizations like improved instrument sounds we present a new song (the title track \"Derp Derp\") and a new instrument, the choir, which is a perfect addition to any band configuration.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Feature",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Instrument improvement: Adjusted loudness, added reverb and new samples for several instruments.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Instrument improvement: Glissandi can now be played across the entire two octave range.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Instrument improvement: Introduced a new system for pitching between notes.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Added new song: Derp Derp.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Added new custom cursor in treble clef shape.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Added new instrument Choir.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Set default volume of all adjustable channels to 80%.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Automatically selecting last used instrument and song.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Making instrument selection scalable and added a badge for new instruments.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "BPM can now also be declared as a floating point number in metadata.json.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Set volume for other players to 80% and volume of self to 90%, by default.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "FIXED",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Making sure to always start a new note when hitting the play button fast multiple times in a row.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Clean-up tones after the track ends.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Resolved multiple errors that were logged when exiting the music arena.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Finally, we have a small outlook on the next content update which can be expected within the next few days:",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "You can look forward to further instruments (e.g., electric guitar), which of course you can use in the new tracks like the \"Ride of the Valkyries\".",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
   "digest": {
    "new": 11,
    "fixed": 5,
    "balance": 0,
    "other": 3,
    "ps5": 0,
    "topNew": [
     "Instrument improvement: Adjusted loudness, added reverb and new samples for several instruments.",
     "Instrument improvement: Glissandi can now be played across the entire two octave range.",
     "Instrument improvement: Introduced a new system for pitching between notes."
    ]
   },
